    "description": "Enjoy the spookiest season of all by joining us for a movie night. We will hold an evening screening of Crimson Peak . Title: Crimson Peak (2016) Running time: 119 minutes Director: Guillermo Del Toro Starring: Mia Wasikowska, Tom Hiddleston, Jessica Chastain, Charlie Hunnam Synopsis: In the aftermath of a family tragedy, an aspiring author is torn between love for her childhood friend and the temptation of a mysterious outsider. Trying to escape the ghosts of her past, she is swept away to a house that breathes, bleeds...and remembers. Please note this movie is rated 14A as per the Ontario Film Review Board. Registration is not required. Drop-in until capacity is reached.",
