    "provider": "Toronto Public Library",
    "description": "Ready for Halloween? The library is just the place to be! We are hosting a fun and spooky Haunted Halloween Open House. Dress up like your favourite character and get ready to be spooked! The Haunted Halloween Open House will occur on the following days/times: Wednesday, October 28, 4:30pm - 6:30pm Thursday, October 29, 4:30pm - 6:30pm Friday, October 30, 4:30pm - 6pm Saturday, October 31, 11:30am - 1pm You may pick your level of scariness each time you visit the Haunted Halloween Open House: Level One (Best for ages 4-7): Lights stay on, music is fun, skips scariest room, no jump scares. Level Two (Best for ages 9-12): Lights are off, scary music, no jump scares. Level Three (Best for ages 13+): Lights are off, scary music, there will be jump scares. Please note this is a drop-in program, and open to all ages.",
