    "organization": "Markham Public Library",
    "provider": "Markham Public Library",
    "description": "Meet with a staff member from ODSP for information about income support, benefits for health costs and other disability supports from the Ontario Disability Support program. ODSP offers: money to help you and your eligible family members with living expenses, including food, and rent health benefits, including prescription drugs and vision care employment support to help you find and keep a job or advance your career Please feel free to stop by if you have any questions about ODSP or need to drop off documents for your Caseworker.",
