    "id": "markham-rss-6a86132d58433600542a9c12",
    "title": "One-on-One Settlement Support Services",
    "organization": "Markham Public Library",
    "provider": "Markham Public Library",
    "description": "Book an appointment with a Settlement Worker! CICS provides free one-on-one settlement services to support newcomers in settling and integrating into the community. Our Settlement Worker can provide information, guidance, referrals, and assistance with applications and forms, particularly for clients who experience language or digital barriers. Support is available on topics such as government benefits, housing, employment, education, healthcare, immigration-related resources, and other community services. Priority is given to Permanent Residents and Convention Refugees. Languages available: English, Cantonese, and Mandarin. Services are available at Cornell Library by appointment (10:00am-3:30pm) and Drop-in enquiries are available 3:30pm-5:00pm **To book an appointment, please call 905-895-3789. Available Dates in October: 27th Available Dates in November: 10th, 17th, 24th Available Dates in December: 8th, 15th Available Dates in February: 9th, 16th, 23rd Available Dates in March: 2nd. CICS 提供免费的一对一安居服务，帮助新移民适应生活并融入社区。我们的安居服务员可提供信息、指导、转介，以及申请和填写表格方面的协助。服务内容包括枫叶卡更新、入籍申请、政府福利、住房、就业、教育、医疗保健、移民相关资源及其他社区服务。 • 永久居民及公约难民可获优先服务。 • 服务语言：英语、粤语及普通话。 • 如需 预约，请致电 905-895-3789 。 This service is facilitated in partnership with CICS - Centre for Immigrant and Community Services",
