    "description": "People are mysteriously disappearing in River City and their fellow humans don't seem to notice or miss them. Where could they be going and what could have happened to them? It might have been your human, or the human of a kitty you know, but the only clues you have point to the main branch of the River City library. Can you find out what’s going on, and more importantly can you rescue the missing humans? Magical Kitties Save the Day is a role-playing game for players 6 and up in which you the player assume the role of a magically endowed feline who secretly looks after your human as well as the larger community. Nobody knows about your magical powers, and you need to keep it that way! *For children ages 6-12. Registration is required.",
