    "description": "Pastry Chef Yumiko Kobayashi leads this hands-on one-hour cupcake workshop where participants will each mix icing, pipe, and decorate two cupcakes. Participants will learn primary techniques like piping with cream cheese and buttercream frosting and decorating. All ingredients to be provided and prepped by the chef. This program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer, where helpful staff are always available. Free, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a Youth Hub or call the branch to find out more. The Mount Dennis Youth Hub is for youth that are 13-17 years old in grades 8-12.",
