    "id": "markham-rss-6a6367d50d65ac360041e536",
    "title": "12岁以下父母课堂 Triple P: Positive Parenting Program - For Parents of Children Under 12 (Mandarin)",
    "organization": "Markham Public Library",
    "provider": "Markham Public Library",
    "description": "Join our 8-session Positive Parenting Program led by Family Services York Region for parents of children under 12. (Triple P) Positive Parenting Program is a world-leading, evidence-based program with 40+ years of research behind it. It gives parents practical tools to foster healthy relationships, manage behaviors, and prevent problems. Triple P 全稱叫做 Positive Parenting Program. 這套由澳洲昆士蘭大學 (University of Queensland) 研發的課程，之所以在全球廣受推崇，是因為它將複雜的行為心理學轉化為家長在廚房、客廳就能實踐的具體技巧。 Our Chinese Triple P sessions tailor this approach to cultural needs, promoting positive behaviors and stronger family connections. 中文課堂在跨文化育兒中至關重要。透過流利的母語，深度探討中西文化差異對親子關係的影響，協助家長更細膩地處理那些隱含在文化習俗中的情緒與期待 Parents will learn: How to establish a blueprint for positive behavior while your child is young. How to implement structured routines and clear guidance that foster a sense of security and order. Shift from \"policing\" behavior to Positive Parenting, ensuring a smoother developmental path for both parent and child. 歲是建立行為基石的黃金期。本課程協助家長奠定孩子良好行為，並在問題發生時進行正向修正，儘量預防成長的下一階段可能發生的摩擦和衝突。 Please Note: - Registration is for all 8 sessions - After registering, the facilitator will reach out by email to arrange a phone intake session prior to the start of the program. - This session is facilitated in Mandarin, and the facilitator also speaks Cantonese. We look forward to seeing you there!",
    "summary": "Join our 8-session Positive Parenting Program led by Family Services York Region for parents of children under 12. (Triple P) Positive Parenting Program is a world-leading, evidence-based program with 40+ years of research behind it. It gives parents practical",
