    "provider": "Markham Public Library",
    "description": "Move, breathe, and reconnect in this 30-minute Yoga for Older Adults class , where you’ll explore gentle stretches, meditation, and breathing techniques designed to encourage mindful movement and body awareness. Geared toward older adults but open to all ages , this welcoming class will guide you through gentle movements for the arms, legs, shoulders, and back at a comfortable pace. You will: Practise gentle yoga stretches and breathing techniques to explore flexibility, movement, and body awareness. Learn meditation and mindful breathing practices that encourage awareness and presence in your body and mind. Format: 30-minute instructor-led yoga class featuring meditation, breathing exercises, and gentle stretching. This program is facilitated through Zoom. Registrants will receive an email with the Zoom link 24 hours before the program start time.",
