    "title": "FRESH Movie Saturdays",
    "organization": "Toronto Public Library",
    "provider": "Toronto Public Library",
    "description": "This program helps people stay active, make friends, learn new skills, and have fun. Meet new folks, build connections, and tell us about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood! Come join us every Saturday for screenings of your favourite movies. In addition to this, enjoy cuddles with a therapy dog! Therapy dog Goose visits Fort York Branch on alternate Saturdays from 11:00AM-12:00PM. We'll be showing the following films: Oct 10 - Planes, Trains and Automobiles Oct 17 - Toy Story 5 Oct 24 - The Absent Minded Professor (1961) Oct 31 - Hotel Transylvania Nov 7 - Herbie the Love Bug (1968) Nov 14 - Africa-An Cats Nov 21 - The Odd Life of Timothy Green Nov 28 - Little Big League Dec 5 – Dog Man Dec 12 – HitPi Dec 19 - A Muppet Christmas Carol Jan 2 - The Incredible Journey (1963) Jan 9 - Trolls Band Together Jan 16 - Pete's Dragon Jan 23 - Turner and Hooch Jan 30 - Soul Feb 6 - The Odd Life of Timothy Green Feb 13 - The Parent Trap (1961) Feb 20 - Escape to Witch Mountain (1975) Feb 27 - Never Cry Wolf Drop-ins are welcome. This program is in collaboration with Gerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative .",
