    "description": "💰How are you doing in your financial wellness? Join the Ontario Securities Commission for an informative session on Financial Wellness , designed to help participants build a healthier relationship with money and make more confident financial decisions. Learning Outcome: Relationship with money Biases that may influence our financial decision making Steps to improve financial wellness 🎤About the Presenter: The On tario Securities Commission is an independent agency that regulates Ontario’s capital markets by making rules that have the force of law and by adopting policies that influence the behaviour of capital markets participants.Their statutory mandate is to provide protection to investors from unfair, improper or fraudulent practices, to foster fair, efficient and competitive capital markets and confidence in the capital markets, to foster capital formation, and to contribute to the stability of the financial system and the reduction of systemic risk. For more information, please visit their website - https://www.osc.ca/en",
