    "id": "markham-rss-6aba7e0c60748300382a0c64",
    "title": "Your Retirement Reset: how to Convert Home Equity into Financial Security",
    "organization": "Markham Public Library",
    "provider": "Markham Public Library",
    "description": "Rewrite the retirement rulebook with the help of Susan Pimento, author of Your Retirement Reset . Retirement has changed, and the old playbook no longer works. Your Retirement Reset will shift the mindset for retirees from fearing financial insecurity to embracing the resources available to them by wisely utilizing their hard-earned assets, including the equity in their home, to create the one thing every senior is searching for: guaranteed, predictable income they can rely on for life. A presentation from the author will be followed by an audience Q&A. Books will be available for purchase. You can also borrow this copy from our website here . Author's bio: Susan Pimento is a financial services professional and advocate. She draws on her decades of experience in the financing industry to improve retirement literacy and help older adults make more informed decisions about housing wealth, financial security, and aging in place.",
