    "description": "刚来加拿大，满脑子问号，不知道该从哪下手？或者已经来了一段时间，想知道是否重要的事项尚有遗漏？别慌！欢迎参加讲座”新移民的安居指南”！ 重点介绍永久居民来到加拿大后，生活的10个重要方面，包括身份文件、语言学习、医疗、财务和社区。我们将提供概述，并引导您找到每个步骤所需的具体支持和资源。 联系各类社区服务，遇事不再一个人扛 。 Are you a new Permanent Resident in Canada? Or have you been in Canada for a while and want a quick check-in? This session offers an overview of 10 key areas for PR card holders. CCSYR will guide you and connect you with the resources you need for deeper support in each area. Get a clear starting point or ensure you're on the right path. This session will be provided in Mandarin. Learning Outcomes: Participants will gain confidence by learning about Newcomer resources and supports available. Participants will gain a deeper understanding about all aspects of their status as a PR Card holder.",
