    "title": "Mandarin Storytime (中文故事會)",
    "organization": "Markham Public Library",
    "provider": "Markham Public Library",
    "description": "Join us for a delightful and interactive Mandarin storytime! Each month, we carefully select picture books in Mandarin inspired by the seasons and cultural festivities. We’ll sing children’s songs, dance, and play games related to the theme, providing an enriching experience that helps children engage with the language and culture. This program is designed for children aged 0 to 8, but all ages are welcome. It takes place in the Children’s Area of the Thornhill Community Centre Library and is conducted entirely in Mandarin. 大手牽小手，來聽故事囉！每個月我們會依節氣與生活主題，精選多本中文繪本，搭配朗朗 上口的兒歌、趣味小遊戲和身體律動，讓孩子在歡笑中愛上閱讀！透過繪本，帶孩子走進中 華文化的世界，感受語言的魅力，認識節慶與傳統，開啟無限的想像力！ 這個活動適合0-8歲孩童，也歡迎所有喜歡故事與繪本的大朋友、小朋友一起參加！ 地點在圖書館兒童區，全程以中文進行。",
