    "description": "Join us for 4 weeks of fun afternoons where participants can connect over shared musical experiences while enjoying some light refreshments. Music Share for Seniors staff will play your favourite songs while you share the memories they inspire. Or sit back, listen and enjoy the musical experiences of those around you. Get ready to jam out while connecting with new friends! Music Share for Seniors is an organization dedicated to reducing senior social isolation through personalized music-based programs and meaningful social interaction. This program is geared towards older adults and seniors. Register in advance or drop-in on the day. Participants are encouraged to join every week and connect with others! Mondays, November 23, 30, December 7, 14 1 – 2:30pm",
