    "description": "Join us on for an interactive storytime full of books, songs and activities for little ones and their caregivers. Drop-in program. Please Note For Tuesday Storytimes Only (Starting August 18th!) Join us every Tuesday for a SPECIAL storytime with an interactive focus on phonics (letter identification and letter sounds). Ideal for 2-6 years old. A few things to consider: Do I have to attend every Tuesday?: This is a drop-in program, so you are welcome to come to any session. Will each session progress to the next one like a curriculum?: Not necessarily. Phonics Storytime will be a fun and creative way to engage with the ABCs. It will be more like our regular storytimes where we freely explore concepts and ideas without a formal lesson. Do I need to register?: Registration is recommended but drop-ins are also and always welcome!",
