    "description": "Do you love reading and talking about books? Join us for an informal, relaxed, and casual meeting to discuss various books throughout the year. The book club will meet monthly on the following dates: Jan 20: In The Upper Country by Kai Thomas Feb 17: Complicated Kindness by Miriam Toews March 17: Full Disclosure by Beverly McLachlin April 21: Half of a Yellow Sun by Chimamanda Adichie May 19: Great Along by Kristin Hannah June 16: Tell the Wolves I’m Home by Kara Rifka Brunt July 21: Cold Mountain by Charles Frazier August 18: A Great Country by Gowda Somaya September 15: How to Say Babylon by Safiya Sinclair October 20: Crying in H Mart: a memoir by Michelle Zauner November 17: Educated by Tara Westover December 15: Horse by Geraldine Brooks Drop in, no registration required.",
