    "title": "Women Entrepreneur Tea and Chat Meetup",
    "organization": "Markham Public Library",
    "provider": "Markham Public Library",
    "description": "💼Are you a women entrepreneurs? Looking for a community of fellow side hustlers and business owners? This meetup is for you! The Women Entrepreneur Tea and Chat Meetup is a dedicated space where women entrepreneurs can come together to share their experiences, exchange resources, and find support within a like-minded community. This meetup offers opportunities for participants to connect, discuss challenges, and offer solutions, whether through recommending trusted professionals such as accountants or sharing insights on overcoming common struggles. By fostering an environment of trust and encouragement, the community circle aims to build a safe, supportive network where women entrepreneurs can grow both personally and professionally. Participants are welcome to stay for the entire duration or leave as needed. Tea will be provided in this meetup. This meetup is on the first Thursday of every month, at Aaniin Library - Room F.",
